diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index a33212c..ccad141 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -14,3 +14,17 @@ A small notes service: create, list and delete notes, with session auth and an a
 ## Development
 
 Copy `.env.example` to `.env`, then run `npm start`.
+
+## Rate limiting
+
+The API now applies request rate limiting to all routes.
+
+- Default policy: 100 requests per 15 minutes per client.
+- Redis-backed shared counters are enabled when `REDIS_URL` is set.
+- Without `REDIS_URL`, the app falls back to the in-process memory store.
+
+Environment variables:
+
+- `REDIS_URL` - Redis connection string for shared rate-limit storage.
+- `RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS` - rate-limit window in milliseconds.
+- `RATE_LIMIT_LIMIT` - max requests allowed per window.
